{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12424","headline":"和王员外雪晴早朝 · 钱起","name":"和王员外雪晴早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫微晴雪带恩光，绕仗偏随鸳鹭行。\n长信月留宁避晓，宜春花满不飞香。\n独看积素凝清禁，已觉轻寒让太阳。\n题柱盛名兼绝唱，风流谁继汉田郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}